// Rule: User Added to Privileged Group (4732)
// Severity: High | MITRE ATT&CK: T1098 Account Manipulation (Privilege Escalation)
// Schedule: run every 5 minutes, look back 5 minutes
// Entities: Account -> FullName = AddedAccount | Host -> HostName = Computer
// Note: 4732 fires for any member added to a security-enabled local group. Filter on Group
// (e.g. "Administrators") to cut noise from additions to Builtin\Users.
// Known issue: for 4732, TargetAccount is the group, not the member who was added (that is in MemberSid),
// so this mapping puts the group in the Account entity. Next fix: map MemberSid, or join it to the 4720 TargetSid.
SecurityEvent
| where EventID == 4732
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, AddedAccount = TargetAccount, PerformedBy = SubjectAccount, Group = TargetUserName
